          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abeeraanyi beitsahaabu nabeinganga bakasinjia eshitonye eshili hakari weshisika tsana shiahekulu hakoona, nende Eshilibwa shiAmakondi.",
